Bootstrap: docker
From: python:3.11-slim

%labels
    Author Mansur Jisan
    Description CORAL sandbox for safe Python code execution on NOAA HPC

%post
    apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
        libgeos-dev \
        libproj-dev \
        && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*

    pip install --no-cache-dir \
        xarray \
        netcdf4 \
        matplotlib \
        cartopy \
        numpy \
        pandas \
        scipy \
        f90nml

%runscript
    exec python3 "$@"

%help
    CORAL sandbox container for executing Python analysis scripts.

    Build:
        apptainer build coral_sandbox.sif containers/coral_sandbox.def

    Run a script:
        apptainer exec --bind /scratch coral_sandbox.sif python script.py

    Use with CORAL viz server:
        Set CORAL_SANDBOX_SIF=/path/to/coral_sandbox.sif
        The viz server will auto-detect and use it for code execution.
